 664:libs/tinyusb/common/tusb_fifo.c ****     It is possible to fill the FIFO by use of a DMA in circular mode. Within
 665:libs/tinyusb/common/tusb_fifo.c ****     DMA ISRs you may update the write pointer to be able to read from the FIFO.
